    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῦλα</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rest, pause</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				88
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐν παύλῃ
			ἐφαίνετο</span> there seemed to be no <i>end of it</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.60
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. νόσου</span>
			<i>cessation</i> or <i>end</i> of disease, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1329
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.124
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1255
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
